    "result_text": "Both tests pass. The change is complete. Here's a summary of what I implemented as a full-stack, additive change.\n\n## What changed\n\nAn invoice's amount is now the sum of its **line items** (description, quantity, price each) rather than a single typed figure \u2014 and the total is worked out automatically.\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V11__invoice_line_items.sql`)\n- New `invoice_line_items` table (`id`, `invoice_id` FK, `description`, `qty`, `unit_price`), following the `GENERATED BY DEFAULT` convention so the seed path can supply explicit fixture ids.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor + Spring)\n- `LineItem` entity + `LineItemRepository` (lines for an invoice, oldest first).\n- `GET /api/invoices/{id}/lineitems` (`InvoiceLineItemsGet`) and `POST /api/invoices/{id}/lineitems` (`InvoiceLineItemsPost` + `NewLineItem`), each a new logic class + YAML file under `rest/api/`. The POST validates the line, saves it, and keeps the invoice's stored `amount` in step (= \u03a3 qty \u00d7 unitPrice) so every existing view that reads `amount` stays correct.\n- `TestSupportController`: added `invoice_line_items` to the reset table list (child-first) and replaced the flat invoice seed with `seedInvoices`, which seeds each invoice's nested `lineItems` and derives the invoice amount from them (still accepting an explicit `amount` for line-less invoices).\n\n**Front-end** (all new files)\n- `features/lineitems/` \u2014 `queries.ts`, `LineItemsTable.tsx` (renders `invoice-lineitems-table`, `lineitem-row-<id>` with description/qty/unit-price/amount cells, and the derived `invoice-amount` total), `LineItemForm.tsx` (`lineitem-form-*` inputs + submit, invalidating `['lineitems', invoiceId]`).\n- `routes/invoice.$invoiceId.tsx` \u2014 the invoice detail page (a standalone route so only the invoice's own detail renders, keeping `invoice-amount` unique on the page).\n- `features/invoices/open.slot.tsx` \u2014 an `invoice-open-<id>` link filling the existing `InvoiceRow` slot, no existing file edited.\n\nNo pinned scaffolding or the test spec was touched. Frontend `typecheck` passes and both `bin/e2e` tests are green.",
